# Operator publication authority is LOCAL state, not repository content.
# Tracking it created a chicken-and-egg: updating the record to name a new tip
# either dirties the tree or changes the very tip it authorises. It also has no
# business travelling to the remote — an authority grant is not an artifact.
build-os/authority/publish-authorization.json
